<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA FAIRS BUYS SIX FAIR TRADEMARKS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA FAIRS BUYS SIX FAIR TRADEMARKS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eesti Naitused (Estonian Fairs) and Expoprojekt have signed a deal, under which Naitused bought the trademarks of six fairs, the company said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Eesti Naitused bought the trademarks of Rebuilding, Ilu maailm (Beauty World), Medifar, Security, Instrutec and Cleanest fairs on April 28, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 6308 400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
